@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Ott Based System Mini Reel

state "Start" as Start
state "Account Created" as AccountCreated
state "Watching Video" as WatchingVideo
state "Uploaded Video" as UploadedVideo
state "Liked Video" as LikedVideo
state "Viewing Likes List" as ViewingLikesList
state "Discussion Option" as DiscussionOption

[*] --> Start

Start --> AccountCreated : Create Account

AccountCreated --> WatchingVideo : Watch Videos
AccountCreated --> UploadedVideo : Upload Videos

WatchingVideo --> LikedVideo : Save to Likes
WatchingVideo --> DiscussionOption : Enter Discussion

UploadedVideo --> WatchingVideo : View Uploaded Video

LikedVideo --> ViewingLikesList : View Saved Videos

ViewingLikesList --> WatchingVideo : Back to Watching

DiscussionOption --> [*] : Exit to Start

@enduml
